  "abstract": "Covers the SPIFFE standards, which are unversioned and pinned by commit and stability level: the Stable line at spiffe/spiffe main f97c46d (SPIFFE ID syntax and trust domain names, SVID trust, X.509-SVID and JWT-SVID rules, trust domain bundles and bundle maps, the Workload Endpoint and Workload API profiles, federation bundle endpoints with the https_web and https_spiffe profiles) and the Incubating preview (WIT-SVID, the Workload API WIT-SVID profile, the Broker API and Broker Endpoint). Maps the standards to SPIRE v1.15.3 server, agent, attestation, registration entries and federation configuration, maps SPIFFE onto the IETF WIMSE drafts (arch-08, identifier-03, workload-creds-02), and covers OAuth client authentication with SVIDs per draft-ietf-oauth-spiffe-client-auth-02. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references hold the version hub and split out SPIFFE IDs, X.509-SVID, JWT-SVID, bundles, the Workload API, federation, SPIRE, WIT-SVID, and WIMSE and OAuth.",
